HIL workflow smoke test
=======================

This is a throwaway marker file used to open a no-op pull request against the
PolyKeyboard branch so the "Build and HIL Test" workflow (.github/workflows/
qmk-test.yml) runs end-to-end:

  1. build      - compile split72 (default + POLYKYBD_HIL force-master) and corne42
  2. hil-test   - flash the force-master uf2 to both halves and run station.test_runner
                  on the self-hosted polykybd-ctnd rig

Safe to delete once the run is confirmed green.

